    ///   predicate, ENABLE ALWAYS trigger, SECURITY DEFINER function, column-level GRANT,
    ///   partial index, EXCLUDE constraint and NOT VALID foreign key is whatever the
    ///   catalogue actually held, not whatever a human believed it held. The dump is
    ///   embedded as SQL resources under MigrationsBaseline/Sql so it stays reviewable
    ///   as SQL and stays out of the C# compiler's working set.
    ///
    ///   Verified: the 17-section schema-parity query set
